Package: zmusic
Version: 0.1-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libasound2, libx11-6, libxext6, libxrender1, libxi6, libgl1, libdbus-1-3
Recommends: hicolor-icon-theme, desktop-file-utils
Maintainer: ZMusic <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AboutUip/ZMusic
Description: ZMusic landscape music client
 ZMusic Linux client. Replicates the Android landscape shell:
 navigation rail, playback, lyrics, and settings.
 Installed to /opt/zmusic; launch with zmusic.
 Registers a desktop launcher under Audio / Sound so it appears
 in GNOME, XFCE, and Kali application menus.
